Cross-Layer Censorship Event Database — Licensing

This repository contains two distinct artifacts under two distinct licenses.
They are released together but governed separately so downstream users can
compose each piece into their own projects without conflating the two.

1. Dataset and documentation — CC-BY-4.0
   ------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Files:
     - events/*.yaml                 (the event records)
     - schema/*.{json,yaml}          (schema + controlled vocabulary)
     - analysis/**                   (generated analysis artifacts)
     - dataset.{json,csv}            (release artifacts)
     - dataset.meta.json             (stable metadata sidecar)
     - docs/**                       (methodology, datasheet, citing, etc.)
     - site/**                       (rendered static site)
     - README.md, CHANGELOG.md, EVENTS-CHECKLIST.md
     - CITATION.cff, .zenodo.json
     - sources/**                    (archived primary-source bodies, where
                                      included in the repo; third-party
                                      sources retain their own rights)

